# ── Machine-local distiller state — MUST NOT sync ─────────────────────────────
# Each machine distills its OWN firehose and tracks its own progress. The shareable
# product is the curated graph (*.md) + INDEX + README + the pipeline (*.sh) + design/.
# Syncing anything below would create phantom "backlog" or clobber another machine's
# triage cursor. (Cross-MACHINE dedup is a later tier — semantic, not this cache.)

# triage / promotion / canary cursors: .last-crosspass .last-distilled .last-run
# .last-staged .last-write-check
.last-*

# distiller run + cross-pass logs: .crosspass.log .distill-run.log
*.log

# per-machine caches / in-flight (not canonical)
signatures/
staging/

# firehose lives at ~/claude-insights.log (outside this dir); never commit it if copied in
claude-insights.log

# editor / OS cruft
*.tmp
*.swp
.DS_Store
